<title>MONACO: SQUASH-MONTE CARLO WOMEN'S CLASSIC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MONTE CARLO WOMEN'S CLASSIC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinals at the women's Monte Carlo squash classic on Friday:</p>
<p>Cassie Jackman (England) beat Michelle Martin (Australia) 1-9 4-9 9-6 9-3 10-9</p>
<p>Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat Liz Irving (Australia) 8-10 9-3 9-2 9-2.</p>
</text>
